  "summary": "Test the key fob and door lock system because multiple doors fail to unlock or open with the fob and the front driver’s door is difficult to unlock manually; no rulebook match supports a targeted test.",
  "rationale": "The narrative reports progressive key-fob unlocking/opening failure across the rear and front doors, plus difficulty unlocking the front driver’s door manually with the key. No conditions, fault codes, recalls, investigations, similar cases, or rulebook matches were provided, so the standard test is proposed rather than a targeted load test.",
  "group": "power_and_wiring",
  "symptoms": [
    "rear driver’s and rear passenger’s side doors fail to unlock with the key fob",
    "front driver’s and passenger’s side doors fail to open with the key fob over time",
    "front driver’s door is difficult to unlock manually with the key"
  ],
  "conditions": [],
  "fault_codes": [],
  "safety_relevant": false,
  "targeted": false,
  "test_name": "standard key fob and door lock functional test",
